<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended lower in moderate trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 23.79 to 6540.05.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.93 to 399.36.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.09.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1307 to 1092.</p>
<p>Volume was 421,795,670 compared with 451,492,500 on Wednesday.</p>
